; Smaragd Dash demo cave 2: creatures (tools/democave.py plays it, with
; 2-creatures.moves; tools/record-tour.sh films it).
;
; Above the path, left to right: a firefly, an alternative firefly, a
; butterfly, an alternative butterfly and a stonefly each fly round a pillar;
; Rockford turns them all with the creature switch at the start. Then a
; dragonfly, a cow and a ghost in their rooms, and an emerald on a replicator:
; the replicator switch starts it, and the voodoo below collects the copies.
; Below the path: boulders and an emerald sink through slime; a biter eats
; dirt (its switch changes its speed); a bladder spender sends bladders up.
; Then a boulder dropped onto a butterfly (emeralds) and one onto a firefly;
; below them an amoeba and an amoeba 2, growing at GDash's own speed: the
; amoeba 2 grows too big and turns into boulders, the amoeba into emeralds.
